  "body": "There should be a `TextTrack.track` getter for getting a `TextTrack`'s corresponding `<track>` element.\n\nI need this because there is no way to get the sources or URLs of the currently enabled tracks. The closest workaround is to hope the user specified labels or ids on the `<track>`, and construct a CSS selector query in order to find the corresponding `<track>` element. This is insufficient for my purposes.\n",
